## Configuration

### @block:watcher
```yaml
patterns:
  - "**/*.spec.{md,yaml,yml,scl}"
  - "**/*.{go,ts,js,py,rs,java}.spec"
  - "**/project.scl"
  - "**/build.{scl,yaml}"
ignore:
  uses: ".gitignore"
  plus: [".speclang/", "*.log", "reports/", ".git/"]
debounce: 100
```

### @block:split
```yaml
max_tokens: 10000
max_lines: 800
strategy: smart
```

### @block:embeddings
```yaml
enabled: true
model: "openai/text-embedding-3-small"
```

### @block:database
```yaml
mode: WAL
```

### @block:cascade
```yaml
quiet_period: 30
max_depth: 50
```
